crates/storage/src/cluster/payload_operations.rs:drain_pending_metadata_command_with_authority_inner:metadata_command_recovery_leader_constructor
crates/storage/src/cluster/payload_operations.rs:drain_pending_metadata_command_with_authorized_recovery_route:metadata_command_authorized_drain_primitive
